  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support on Sectoral plans and WASH/DRR related awareness and BCC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component covers the cost required for all the social mobilisation aspect of the work example, preparation and implementation of sectoral plans. Additionally, it includes the full cost of WASH and DRR-related behaviour change and communication initiatives, such as conducting trainings, capacity building, and the development and distribution of IEC materials.</narrative>
  </description>
